                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "You will need a friend or family member and two gamepads. You can play locally and fight each other (local multiplayer 1vs1).\nYour job is to grab a log and set it on fire, to melt the ice, pick up the key and to deliver it to the portal.\n\nThe Ragdoll Physics give the game an oddball appeal. \nSeeing the characters hopping and running fall and do somersaults is really funny.\n\nIt’s still in Early Access, but it’s stable + with very simple controls and mechanics + it’s a good, cool and light-hearted couch co-op experience.\nThe gameplay is balanced as well, allowing players of all skill levels to enjoy themselves.\nYou’ll have a lot of fun with Wizard Bros.",
